### Test 1: Save - Create with schedule
POST {{baseUrl}}/Workplan/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workplanName": "Ruta Occidente - Lunes",
  "validateOnIgnitionOff": true,
  "stopNotAuthorized": 10,
  "locations": [
    {
      "locationId": 88123
    },
    {
      "locationId": 88124,
      "startTime": "10:00",
      "endTime": "12:00"
    }
  ],
  "unitId": 5001,
  "scheduleId": 12,
  "duration": 480
}

### Test 2: Save - Rename only
POST {{baseUrl}}/Workplan/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workplanId": 930,
  "workplanName": "Ruta Occidente - Lunes (nueva)"
}

### Test 3: Save - Remove destination geofence
POST {{baseUrl}}/Workplan/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workplanId": 930,
  "destinationGeofenceId": 0
}

